  consent_note: >-
    This article names real, identifiable community organizers (Tereza
    Bízková and Juan Giraldo of ReFi Medellín; Daniela, Ximena, Diana
    Monclou, and Fabio Anaya of ReFi Cartagena) and recommends specific
    governance/treasury structures (multisig signer counts, role
    concentration limits) for local nodes. The named individuals are already
    public in the article's own cited sources (a public Medium interview and
    a public grant report on the ReFi coordination hub), but this ingestion
    reproduces their names and roles secondhand without directly
    re-confirming current consent for wider reuse. Governance/treasury
    recommendations are general best-practice guidance, not org-specific
    advice, and should be reviewed by a steward before being presented as
    authoritative for any one node's specific situation.
  review_type: steward-review-before-public-use
